5,1,1,talk,Midori,,Hello everyone. I am very happy to be part of this panel. I hope we can work together harmoniously to find the best ERP replacement for our company. I look forward to our discussion.,"{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,It is a pleasure to meet you all. I believe a cautious and thorough evaluation is necessary here. I look forward to analyzing the data to ensure we make a rational choice for the company.,"{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,May,,"Hi everyone! I'm so excited to be here. Let's make this process a bit more lively, shall we? I'm looking forward to seeing what we uncover and picking a winner that actually works!","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Misaki,,Hello. I agree that a thorough process is necessary. I look forward to working with you all to find a solution that is sustainable for the company.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,"Indeed, a most auspicious beginning. While enthusiasm is a delightful catalyst, I believe a measured approach to the archives will serve us best. I look forward to uncovering the truths hidden within our records.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Midori,,I believe it is important to understand how we handle crises and changes. I would like to look into the support ownership during last winter's outage and the board minutes on capital and operating requests.,"{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,"I want to ensure the new system is compatible with our physical reality. I will examine the yard devices and the 2021 scheduling trial, as well as the depot calendar and the peak-season cutover.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,May,,I'm curious about how things actually hold up over time. I'll dive into the five years of renewal invoices and the upgrade history of the dispatch tool. Let's see if we've been playing a game of patch-work!,"{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Misaki,,"I want to understand the human impact of our transitions. I will look into administrator retirements and hiring times, as well as the depot supervisors and the last rollout.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"A most comprehensive spread of interests. To ensure our financial horizons are not obscured by optimistic projections, I shall examine the board minutes on capital and operating requests and the five years of renewal invoices.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Midori,,It seems we have a very balanced approach. I am glad to see that we are looking at everything from the financial side to the human element. I believe this will help us make a fair decision.,"{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Ryuji,,"I agree. By covering the operational, financial, and human aspects, we minimize the risk of overlooking a critical failure point. I believe this breadth of investigation is the most rational way to proceed.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,May,,"Exactly! We've got the numbers, the people, and the hardware all covered. I can't wait to see if the records are as boring as Benjamin expects or if there's some real drama in there!","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Misaki,,I believe the breadth of our research will provide the necessary clarity. I am interested to see if the operational reality matches the official plans.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,"Drama is often the byproduct of poor planning, May. I suspect the records will reveal a rather mundane tragedy of administrative oversight. I shall await the revelations with a measured curiosity.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Midori,,I agree with Benjamin that planning is key. I hope our findings allow us to avoid past mistakes and create a supportive environment for everyone. I am ready to see what we discover.,"{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
21,1,4,pass,Midori,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
22,1,4,talk,Ryuji,,I concur. A rational decision requires a foundation of evidence rather than hope. I am ready to review the findings and assess how they align with our operational constraints.,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
23,1,4,pass,Ryuji,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
24,1,4,talk,May,,I'm all set too! Let's hope the data gives us something juicy to talk about. I'm ready to dive in and see what's really going on behind the scenes!,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
25,1,4,pass,May,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
26,1,4,talk,Misaki,,I am also ready. I hope the records provide a clear picture of our capacity to handle this change. I look forward to the results.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
27,1,4,pass,Misaki,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
28,1,4,talk,Benjamin,,"Since we have reached a consensus on our respective areas of inquiry with such remarkable efficiency, I shall also declare myself ready. Let us see if the archives are as cooperative as our conversation has been.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
29,1,4,pass,Benjamin,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
